# Hey, I'm Keelan 👋

University Student & Founder of **[Visionry](https://visionaryoptimisation.com)** — a WhatsApp-based booking 
system built for Driving Instructors in Ireland.

## What I'm Building

Visionry lets driving instructors manage lesson bookings entirely through WhatsApp —  
no app downloads, no portals, no friction. Students book, reschedule, and cancel via 
natural conversation. Instructors get Google Calendar sync and a live admin dashboard.

**Stack:** Node.js · Supabase · WhatsApp Business API · Google Calendar API  
**Hosting:** Railway (API) · Cloudflare Pages (Dashboard + Website)

## Repos

| Repo | What it is |
|------|------------|
| [visionry-api] (private for now) | Core backend — webhook handler, booking logic, slot generation |
| [visionry-dashboard] (private for now) | Admin dashboard for instructors |

